{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011smFq9VXm5bnjJ1bTiC9Yf","type":"tool_result","content":"> scenes\n> node engine/src/cli.ts scenes\n\ncounter-title      2.5–7 с\n  Hook or punchline: one huge number counts up to its value with a unit word under it. Durations, counts, sizes. Best as the first beat.\n  параметры: value, format, unit, heat\n  якоря: ignite*, unit, cool\n  текстовые слоты (type): counter (number), unit (label)\nfraction-finale    3.5–9 с\n  Final card: a big fraction with a hero slash and a segmented scale; the highlighted segments carry a label. Last beat.\n  параметры: numerator, denominator, label, segments, spark, fade\n  якоря: numerator, slash, fill, outline, label, fade\n  текстовые слоты (type): numerator (number), denominator (number), label (label)\nmap-marker         5–12 с\n  Place on a map: a coastline silhouette, a marker with a name, optional route, a counter with a label, a row of up to three words and a peak with a label.\n  параметры: map, marker, label, labelSide, region, regionAt, route, routeTo, counterValue, counterFormat, counterPrefix, counterLabel, items, peak, peakLabel, peakNote, peakGlow, peakAt\n  якоря: marker, route, routeEnd, counter, counterLabel, item1, item2, item3, peak, peakLabel, peakNote\n  текстовые слоты (type): label (title), region (label), count (number), counterLabel (label), peakLabel (label)\npicture-zoom       3–9 с\n  A licensed painting or photo with a slow push toward a point, particles drifting over it, an optional big title and a small credit line. For the one real image of the story.\n  параметры: image, fit, crop, focus, zoomFrom, zoomTo, particles, tint, title, credit, creditSub\n  якоря: credit, title\n  текстовые слоты (type): title (title), credit (label)\npyroclastic-flow   6–13 с · геройская\n  Hero scene for volcanic disasters only: an ash column collapses, a burning avalanche floods the frame with a speed counter, then ash strata rise with a depth range.\n  параметры: speedValue, speedPrefix, speedUnit, depthFrom, depthTo, depthUnit, depthLabel\n  якоря: collapse, flood*, speed, approx, speedLand, speedUnit, cool, strata, depthLabel, depthFrom, depthTo, depthUnit\n  текстовые слоты (type): speed (number), speedUnit (label), depthLabel (label)\nscale-gauge        5–13 с\n  A height (up) or depth (down) figure: a marker and a counting readout ride a vertical scale while the scenery shows it — an ash column over a town (volcano) or a ship sinking through dark water to the seabed (ocean). Optional date and one word.\n  параметры: direction, value, unit, scenery, dateValue, dateSuffix, word\n  якоря: date, dateSuffix, rise*, value, fall, word, layer, collapse, rumble\n  текстовые слоты (type): readout (number), date (number), word (title)\nyear-odometer      4.5–11 с\n  A year rolls in on odometer drums (optionally brushed out of ash), then a ± number with a unit; optional cross-section with voids below.\n  параметры: year, delta, deltaSign, deltaUnit, dust, dig, section, voids, voidLabel\n  якоря: year*, yearLand, delta, section, voids, fill, leader\n  текстовые слоты (type): year (number), delta (number), deltaUnit (label), voidLabel (label)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64169bf9-5b90-4df6-b6aa-8fc4b1d02447","uuid":"75f490f5-c620-42c0-9342-3842ca0eb8cf","timestamp":"2026-09-15T10:25:49.452Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"> scenes\n> node engine/src/cli.ts scenes\n\ncounter-title      2.5–7 с\n  Hook or punchline: one huge number counts up to its value with a unit word under it. Durations, counts, sizes. Best as the first beat.\n  параметры: value, format, unit, heat\n  якоря: ignite*, unit, cool\n  текстовые слоты (type): counter (number), unit (label)\nfraction-finale    3.5–9 с\n  Final card: a big fraction with a hero slash and a segmented scale; the highlighted segments carry a label. Last beat.\n  параметры: numerator, denominator, label, segments, spark, fade\n  якоря: numerator